The following are 18 files containing tabelled information about nethack
(the pc-version 2.?? without many options).

I once got this information and took the time to put it in Troff-format.
I hope they don't contain too much errors.

Anyway, I cat'ed them all, and separated them by "========="-lines, to save
us all from having to read/skip 18 different files.
The subsequent files are dealing with:

armor		characters	food		fountains	gems
dead monsters	(2 parts)	living monsters	(2 parts)	potions
rings		scrolls		spells		thrones		tools
traps		wands		weapons		

You should "uncat" them, using your best-liked editor, thus getting
18 seperate files.
You can then print them, using Troff (probably Nroff will work too).
Note: there may be local macro's that I have used in the files.

You could also try to remove the "======="-lines, and print it in whole,
but here at my site, troff then continues vertical lines on the next
page.

Following this file, I will also post a shorter file, containing some of
the following information in plain text format, and a much longer file
with tables and tips is plain text format.

Now don't anyone of you dare to ask for these tables/cheatsheets/spoilers
again!!!

P.S. I will post these only once, and I won't email them!

