searching	T{
Find secret doors/traps more easily, sometimes without searching. Also finds mimics and piercers.
T}
fire resistance	Invulnerable for fire, including wands and dragon breath.
see invisible	Same as potion with the same name.
gain strength	Just what it says. Can be cursed: -1, -2, ...
stealth	Monsters don't wake up when you enter a room.
hunger	Increases hunger, cursed.
teleport control	T{
Gives you control of teleport destination, no matter what does the teleporting. Try to teleport into a wall or monster and you get a random teleport. Gives no control of when you go, just where.
T}
teleportation	T{
Teleports you randomly about every once in a while. No way to control when, but a ring of teleport control determines where. Without this ring, teleportation is random on level. Usually stickeycursed, makes very hungry.
T}
increase damage	Increases the damage you do to monsters. Can be cursed: -1, -2, ...
levitation	T{
Equivalent to a potion of levitation when worn. Has minor advantages in avoiding traps and small monsters, but if cursed, it could spell the end of your character! You are unaffected by traps, but you cannot pick anything up or go downstairs.
T}
warning	Glows in various colors, indicating monsters, traps, etc. Code unknown.
poison resistance	T{
You are invulnerable to poison, including poisoned corpses, excluded rotten corpses. Also protects from poisoned stings, bites and potions. Does not protect you from rotten (tainted) meat or potions of sickness.
T}
