.TS
box;
c  c  c
l| n| l.
Name	Chance	Description
_
light	10	Use in dark rooms. Usually 10+ charges.
secret door detection	5	T{
Discovers all secret doors in room or in sight in a corridor. If there are none, charge is used and wand seems to do nothing. Also detects shape-changers. Usually 10+ charges.
T}
create monster	5	T{
Creates a monster next to you. May be useful if very hungry. If you are, create a monster, kill it, and feast on the remains!
T}
wishing	1	T{
You usually get three wishes, and wishing for a wand of wishing gives wands with no charges left. When it asks what you want, answer exactly like it would appear in het inventory. The wand does not identify it for you, so name it.
If you wish for an illegal item you get a random one. You can wich for any item up to +3, above that you take your chances. You can wish for one wand or three of any other non-plussed items with each wish.
Sample wishes:
- +3 plate mail/pair of gloves/helmet/elven cloak/crysknife
- 3 potions of gain level
- ring of regeneration/teleport control
- 3 tins (No way to specify spinach, but the odds are good)
Wishing for "wand of wishing (3)" will not work. "Illegal" wishes that seem to work often are +7 plate mail, 3 +3 crysknives (but sometimes gives 3 -3 crysknives).
